xbrli:xbrl.in-bse-shp:DisclosureOfNotesOnShareholdi:
a. Harsh Samara Gupta Trust, acquired 100 Equity Shares of Rossell India Limited (Target Company) on 17th June, 2026 by way of an off-market transfer through gift from Mr. Harsh Mohan Gupta, who forms part of the promoter of the Target Company;

b. Harsh Rishab Gupta Trust, acquired 100 Equity Shares of Rossell India Limited (Target Company) on 17th June, 2026 by way of an off-market transfer through gift from Mr. Harsh Mohan Gupta, who forms part of the promoter of the Target Company;

Both the aforesaid Trusts are controlled by Mr. Harsh Mohan Gupta, in his capacity as Trustee, and Mr. Harsh Mohan Gupta also forms part of the Promoter of the Target Company. Further, the settlors of the trusts also forms part of the Promoter of the Target company. Accordingly, the aforesaid trusts have been be classified as part of the Promoter and/or as a Person Acting in Concert (PAC) with the promoters under SEBI (Substantial Acquisition of Shares and Takeovers) Regulations, 2011. 

c. Pursuant to the Regulation 2(1)(pp) of SEBI (ICDR) Regulations, 2018, both Rossell Techsys Limited and Rossell Techsys Inc. USA, have been classified as part of the Promoter Group. Accordingly, the same has been disclosed under the Promoter Group in the Shareholding Pattern with NIL shareholdings, in compliance with the SEBI circular.
